@startuml agentic-culture-boundary
title Agentic Culture Boundary ; per ADR-ES-023 + CR-ES-023

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Culture" as Cult
class "Agentic Culture" as ACult
class "Agentic Organization" as AOrg
class "Agentic Operations" as AOp
class "Agentic Workflow" as AWf
class "Agent" as Ag

Cult <|-- ACult : specializes

ACult --> AOrg : supports
ACult --> AOp : supports
ACult --> AWf : supports
ACult --> Ag : engages-with

note right of ACult
  Per ADR-ES-023 section 4 + section 8 + section 9 + section 10:
  Agentic Culture is NOT AI Culture
  Agentic Culture is NOT Automated Culture
  Agentic Culture is NOT Agentic Organization
  Agentic Culture is NOT Agentic Enterprise
  Agentic Culture is NOT Autonomous Culture (orthogonal)
end note

@enduml
